  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since update 2018.4.4, it's nice to see cloning avatars is much easier. Funny to see same avatars as me or others.\n\nBUT!!!!\nWe almost forgot there are also avatars with HEAVY animations / effects. If such avatars are cloned by others and they want try it out... oh man, that will explode my cpu usage. Might even crash VRChat. Some users will dislike it.\n\nTo avoid excess use of special animations, there should warning message don't use it many times and please try it out in calmy worlds or where less avatars are cloned.\n\nBecause even it's for fun, firing all avatars almost at same time is no fun at all. If the avatar has heavy animations, warning will showed. If the avatar has no heavy animations (emotes without lights / effects) no warning is showed and you can use it normally what you like.\n\nThe warning is more for new users who want try out cloned avatar, but that is not good idea in busy world... That goes even for all users to avoid trying out too much.",
